{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15843","headline":"书情寄上苏州韦使君兼呈吴县李明府 · 崔峒","name":"书情寄上苏州韦使君兼呈吴县李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数年湖上谢浮名，竹杖纱巾遂性情。\n云外有时逢寺宿，日西无事傍江行。\n陶潜县里看花发，庾亮楼中对月明。\n谁念献书来万里，君王深在九重城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}